msgstr "Profile saved."

msgid "密码不正确。"
msgstr "Incorrect password."

msgid "请输入当前密码，并输入 DELETE 确认删除。"
msgstr "Enter your current password and type DELETE to confirm."

msgid "账号已删除"
msgstr "Account deleted"

msgid "账号、草稿、提交、学习记录及你发布的社区内容已从当前数据库删除。审核事件只保留不含正文的操作记录，操作者关联已清除。备份按站点保留周期清除。"
msgstr "Your account, drafts, submissions, learning records and community content were deleted from the current database. Moderation events retain action records without text, and the actor link was cleared. Backups expire according to the site's retention policy."

msgid "源代码"
msgstr "Source code"

msgid "源代码必须是有效的 UTF-8 文本。"
msgstr "Source code must be valid UTF-8 text."

msgid "请提供不超过 20000 字符的源代码及有效的提交方式。"
msgstr "Provide source code of at most 20000 characters and a valid submission action."

