msgstr "Foundational"

msgid "进阶"
msgstr "Advanced"

msgid "当前评测环境不支持这道题的运行方式；仍可阅读、编辑和保存草稿。"
msgstr "The current evaluation environment does not support this problem’s execution mode. You can still read the problem, edit code, and save drafts."

msgid "JavaScript / QuickJS 2026-06-04；只支持同步 JSON 函数，不提供 Node.js、DOM、网络或模块导入。每用例 128 MiB 线性内存、15 秒总等待、32 KiB 输出；运算量超限也会终止。"
msgstr "JavaScript / QuickJS 2026-06-04; synchronous JSON functions only. Node.js, the DOM, networking, and module imports are unavailable. Each case allows 128 MiB of linear memory, 15 seconds of total waiting time, and 32 KiB of output. Execution also stops when the operation limit is exceeded."

msgid "Python 3.14.9 / WASI 完整程序；从标准输入读取文本，标准输出须恰为一个 JSON 值。编译检查与运行分别限 15 秒、128 MiB 线性内存；输出上限 32 KiB。没有网络、文件写入、进程、线程或第三方扩展。"
msgstr "Python 3.14.9 / WASI complete program; read text from standard input and write exactly one JSON value to standard output. Compilation checks and execution each allow 15 seconds and 128 MiB of linear memory; output is limited to 32 KiB. Networking, file writes, processes, threads, and third-party extensions are unavailable."

msgid "Python 3.14.9 / WASI 基础标准库；不支持网络、文件写入、进程、线程和第三方扩展。每用例 128 MiB 线性内存、15 秒总等待、32 KiB 输出；运算量超限也会终止。"
msgstr "Python 3.14.9 / WASI basic standard library; no network, file writes, processes, threads or third-party extensions. Each case has 128 MiB linear memory, 15 seconds total wait and 32 KiB output; exceeding the instruction budget also terminates execution."

msgid "Python 3.11.15 标准库；每用例 128 MiB 内存、2 秒 CPU、8 秒总等待、32 KiB 输出。"
msgstr "Python 3.11.15 standard library; each case has 128 MiB memory, 2 seconds CPU, 8 seconds total wait and 32 KiB output."

msgid "等待评测超时，请稍后重新提交。"
msgstr "The wait for judging timed out. Please submit again later."

msgid "账号与隐私 · PraxiMesh"
msgstr "Account and privacy · PraxiMesh"

msgid "ACCOUNT / 账号与隐私"
msgstr "ACCOUNT / Privacy and settings"

msgid "你的代码，属于你。"
msgstr "Your code belongs to you."

msgid "源代码、草稿、收藏、笔记与学习记录仅自己可见。社区内容只有主动送审并通过后，正文和用户名才会公开。公开主页与评测结果须另行主动分享。基本资料中的显示名称仍是私密资料。"
msgstr "Your code, drafts, bookmarks, notes and learning records are private. Community text and your username become public only after you request review and receive approval. Public profiles and results require separate, explicit sharing. Your profile display name remains private."

