msgstr "Export my data"

msgid "包含账号资料、源代码、草稿、提交结果、路径、收藏、笔记、阅读记录、本人社区内容、公开主页设置和分享选择；包含访问令牌用途和到期时间，不包含令牌密钥、密码、恢复码或他人的私密信息。"
msgstr "Includes your account details, code, drafts, results, paths, bookmarks, notes, reading records, community content, public profile settings and sharing choices, plus token purposes and expiry times. Excludes token secrets, passwords, recovery codes and other people's private information."

