msgstr "Delete account"

msgid "此操作删除账号、草稿、提交、学习记录、访问令牌、公开主页、分享成绩和你发布的社区内容。不能撤销。审核事件仅保留不含正文的操作记录，并清除操作者关联。备份按站点保留周期清除。"
msgstr "This permanently deletes your account, drafts, submissions, learning records, access tokens, public profile, shared results and community content. Moderation events retain action records without text, and the actor link is cleared. Backups expire according to the site's retention policy."

